# Paths ignored by GitHub Copilot (code review / completions).
#
# Device-UI golden snapshots are generated binary images, not source. They
# dominate PR file counts (thousands of PNGs) and add no review value.
# NOTE: `.copilotignore` is not officially documented; the supported path is
# repo/org "content exclusion" settings. Also, Copilot code review's 300-file
# cap is applied *before* exclusions, so this may not unblock huge PRs on its
# own — if it doesn't, split the snapshot changes into a separate PR.
tests/**/*.png
